<title>USA: NYSE says USLife no comment on stock action.</title>
<headline>NYSE says USLife no comment on stock action.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said USLife Corp had no comment when asked about the unusual market activity of its stock Tuesday.</p>
<p>The stock was up 3-3/8 to 39-5/8 in late afternoon trading of 316,000 shares.</p>
<p>The NYSE said it requested the company issue a public statement regarding any developments that might explain the stock's activity.</p>
